  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-2092f317-7fff-b918-0eca-53b8dda5dd1e&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of its detailed design, appearance, and form, results in an inappropriate solid-to-void ratio that would fail &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;to respect the architectural character of the original host building and its setting, being the wider terrace it forms part of. Furthermore, the proposed glazing to the rear lower ground and ground floors fails to conserve or enhance and reveal the significance of the adjoining locally listed building at no.42 Clissold Crescent and its setting.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;As such, the proposal is contrary to the policies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character), LP4 (Non-Designated Heritage Assets) and LP17 (Housing Design) of the Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020) and policies D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach) and D4 (Delivering good design) of The London Plan (2021) and the advice contained within Hackney&#x27;s &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2009).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
